          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 1.0,
          "description": "drivecycle.rs:230. A second below 1 mph is Idling; at national scale a second at exactly 0 mph is Idling too rather than the project-scale mode 501, so the two arms collapse to this one predicate."
        },
